# The dashboard's Ed25519 public key (issue #185).
#
# The API verifies every request against this key. It is embedded in
# the binary at compile time: there is no runtime path that reads a
# key file, and no configuration knob that replaces it. Changing the
# dashboard's key therefore means a new release.
#
# The value is the raw 32-byte public key in lower-case hex — NOT a
# PEM file and NOT a DER SubjectPublicKeyInfo: the key is the last
# thing that needs a parser.
#
# ── DEVELOPMENT PLACEHOLDER ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is a **development** key. It belongs to no dashboard and must be
# replaced with the real one before the first release that ships this
# feature; the matching seed lives in `tests/fixtures/` so the end-to-
# end suite can sign requests against the built binary. Both files are
# replaced together when the production key is put in place.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
